From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 09:26:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Allocator and call-return stack hardening for the iOS port

Allocate, check, then construct (ml790); name a failed container
allocation and stop instead of dereferencing NULL, which is how VA
exhaustion used to present (ml798); the VA band written by ntdll is read
rather than assumed (ml797); call-return stack instrumentation in
CallRetStack.h; rpmalloc submodule pointer update.

Madeira-commit: 38dddb32035c5b3adb898d84c869f7b40cbf9ab9
Rebased: resolved
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-24-fex-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
